    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apolo ku yaabaire akiri Korinso, Paulo yaaraba omu kyanga kya ruguru, yaahika Efeso, yaashangayo abeegi bamwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaababuuza ati: Obu mwaikiriza, mukaheebwa Omwyoyo Orikwera? Baamugarukamu bati: Ngaaha, n'okuhurira titukahuriraga, yaaba habaho Omwoyo Orikwera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaagira ati: Mukabatizibwa omu kubatizibwa ki? Bati: Omu kubatuza kwa Yohaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.3.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 3:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Paulo yaagira ati: Yohaana akabatiza okubatiza kw'okweteisa, naagambira abantu kwikiriza Ogwo orikwenda kwija enyima ye, niwe Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku baahuriire ekyo, baabatizibwa omu iziina rya Mukama waitu Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.8.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Byak 8:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.10.44"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "10:44",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Paulo ku yaabataireho engaro, Omwoyo Orikwera yaabaijaho; baagamba endimi ezindi, baaragura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boona bakaba bari ikumi na babiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaataaha omuri sinagogi, yaamara ameezi ashatu naagamba n'obumanzi, naahakanisa abantu, kandi naabaikiririsa eby'obukama bwa Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka bamwe ku baagangaize emitima, baayanga kuhurira nibajuma Omuhanda ogwo omu maisho g'abantu, yaabarugaho, yaashorooramu abeegi, yaaguma naahakanira omu ishomero rya Turaano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaagumizamu naakora atyo okumara emyaka ebiri; n'ahabw'ekyo boona abaabaire batwire Asia, Abayudaaya n'Abagriika, baahurira ekigambo kya Mukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga yaakoresa emikono ya Paulo eby'okutangaaza ebitari by'obutoosha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi ebitambaara n'emyenda ebyarugire aha mubiri gwe baabitwarira abarwaire, baakira endwara zaabo, n'abariho baadaimoni baabarugaho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.9.49"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 9:49",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Hakaba hariho ebizengyerezi by'Abayudaaya, abatiriki b'emizimu, baayehanga kutsirika baadaimoni omu iziina rya Mukama waitu Yesu, nibagira bati: Ninkwitsa Yesu ou Paulo agamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakaba hariho abashaija mushanju, batabani ba Skewa Omuyudaaya, omunyamurwa omukuru, abaabaire nibakora batyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.4.41"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 4:41",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Daimoni yaabagarukamu ati: Yesu nimmumanya, na Paulo nimmumanya; beitu imwe muri baahi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omushaija owaabaire ariho daimoni yaabagurukira boona, yaabakiza amaani, yaababinga, baahunga omu nju egyo bajwaire busha, bahutaire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.5.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Byak 5:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.5.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi ekyo kyamanywa boona, Abayudaaya n'Abagriika, abaabire batwiire Efeso; boona baatiina munonga, kandi eiziina rya Mukama waitu Yesu ryahimbisibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi baingi ahari abo abaikiriize baija, baayatura ebibi byabo, baagamba n'ebi baakozire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baingi ahari abo, abaabaire bakora eby'obufumu baateeranira hamwe ebitabo byabo eby'okuragura, baabyokeza omu maisho g'abantu boona; baabariirira obuguzi bwabyo, baashanga nibuhika ebicweka by'efeeza obukumi butaano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwo nikwo ekigambo kya Mukama kyayeyongyeire kityo amaani, kikasingura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.23.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Byak 23:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.1.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 1:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi ebyo ku byahweire, Paulo yaamariirira omu mutima gwe kubanza kuraba Makedonia na Akaya, ngu abone kuza Yerusaalemu, naagira ati: Ku ndiba naahikireyo, nshemereire kuza kureeba Rooma nayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.17.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Byak 17:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.16.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 16:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku yaaherize kutuma Makedonia babiri aha bahwezi be, Timoseo na Erasto, we yaaguma Asia ebiro bikye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
